    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Ascension Layer.</strong> When you move in service of the Great Work, reality bends to keep the story alive.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Ascension Aura:</strong> While you are pursuing an active Spark quest or directly working a Great Work objective, you and allies within 6 squares gain a +2 bonus to all defense check.</p></li><li><p><strong>Fate Catch (1/a Soma Break):</strong> While Ascension Aura is active, when you or an ally within 6 squares fails a defense check, you may use your reaction to treat that failure as a success instead.</p></li><li><p><strong>World-Tuned:</strong> Bad Eden travel, encounter, and hex/faction systems may treat catastrophic outcomes related to the current Spark quest as reduced in severity—fumbles become partial failures, disasters become hard lessons instead of dead ends.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
